  "limits": [
    "All ten existing extraction cases agree in command status, piece counts, attributes, selection, source retention, endpoints and both vertex-to-polyline probes at 1e-6. The strengthened Rust regression additionally compares actual vertex sequences. Seven nonempty cases previously differed; the worst diagnostic distance decreased from about 0.118 to about 1.8e-14 model units. These checks qualify only the retained cases.",
    "The broader comparison has 44 rows: 38 matching vertex-sequence cases, three genuine subdivision differences (cubic-space, quartic-wave, quadratic-tight), and three requested outline settings that native Rhino did not apply. Of the 41 settings-applied rows, 38 match. Native output ordering and orientation may differ. Hair rendering, general native subdivision, surface display and performance remain unqualified.",
    "The initial sampler hypothesis was checked on additional curves; all three counterexamples remain. The final sampler is an independently written bounded source-control heuristic, not a claim to reproduce proprietary native algorithms. Rational control cones are a display heuristic, not a denominator or curvature certificate. Singularities between sampled stations can remain unresolved.",
    "Native ClosestPoint-based station recovery can choose the wrong branch on looping curves (observed residual about 0.182). Actual native polylines, not recovered parameters, determine geometry comparisons. Recovered stations, returned NURBS and native output vertices never enter local producer inputs. Local fixtures copy only original source recipes and requested scale/hair density.",
    "The native diagnostic probe evolved during discovery to retain full polylines, span tangents and setup-density echoes. The final 15-case outline capture uses the final probe. Current source hashes do not assert byte-identical producer provenance for earlier intermediate captures; their raw settings, residuals, recipes and observed outputs remain available.",
    "Native nested-script Undo remains unqualified from the prior extraction capture. Local model undo/redo, source preservation, trimmed-face hole clipping and graph cache behavior pass portable and native checks. Transient transform/grip previews, SubDs and saved analysis metadata remain outside this change.",
    "Only the existing owned private headless launcher and public Rhino SDK/commands were used. No Wine/FEX/license configuration, vendor sources, new C ABI, sanitizer or benchmark qualification changed. Existing analytic and differential operations are reused.",
    "Historical metadata and hash values remain intact using immutable Git references. 16 affected entries in 2 baseline-valid records were preserved. The pre-existing 69 unverifiable historical records remain untouched."
  ],
